			"notes": "**New: Copper Gutters:**\n- New blocks: Gutter, Drain Pipe, Drain & Basin.\n- Gutters connect with each other to form runs\n- Place a drain pipe one block away from a gutter and connect it to a drain and it'll spray water when it rains!\n- Place a basin or cauldron next to the drain and it'll fill up with rain faster than a cauldron in open weather\n- Basin: Can be used to clear of dye from leather, last pattern off a banner and the color of a shulker\n\n**Slats:**\n- Pink petals can now be applied to slats, similar to vines\n- When upgrading, existing slats will lose their vines (sorry)\n- Logs now craft into 32 plank slats instead of 8"
		},
